---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Our story · Mental Note" active="our-story">
<div class="phead"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div>
  <h1>Two students started this.</h1>
</div></div>
<div class="light"><div class="block" style="padding-top:44px"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="people">
    <div class="person">
      <div class="photo paper lit tape dk"><div class="in2">Photo</div><div class="cap">Co-founder 1</div></div>
      <h3>Co-founder 1</h3><div class="role">Co-executive director</div>
      <p>Writes the personal essays and speaks at assemblies and health classes. Author of <em>Book Title</em>, a philosophical memoir written from a teenage perspective.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="person">
      <div class="photo paper lit tape dk"><div class="in2">Photo</div><div class="cap">Co-founder 2</div></div>
      <h3>Co-founder 2</h3><div class="role">Co-executive director</div>
      <p>Builds the site and the app, runs operations, and speaks on building technology for mental health and starting a nonprofit in high school.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="plain">Mental Note is peer-led. We're two high school students, not clinicians. We don't provide counseling, therapy, or crisis services — we write about mental health from experience, cite our sources, and point people toward professionals who can actually help.</p>
</div></div>

<div class="block" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="eyebrow">Where the money goes</div>
  <h2>A nonprofit, plainly.</h2>
  <dl class="qa">
    <div><dt>How we're structured</dt><dd>Fiscally sponsored by The Hack Foundation, a 501(c)(3). We operate under their nonprofit status.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>How we're funded</dt><dd>School talks, workshops, and donations. No ads, ever.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>What we do with data</dt><dd>We never sell it, share it, or use it to train anything. Check-ins never leave your phone.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>The book</dt><dd>One founder's book is her own work, published separately. It isn't a program of Mental Note.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div></div></div>
</Layout>
